            <description>
                This document is a detailed, comprehensive guide that provides an overview of the
                Cassini ISS F Ring mosaics and associated reprojected versions of Cassini ISS
                calibrated images archived in the PDS. It provides details essential to
                understanding and using the data in the bundle. Example Python programs are
                also included.
            </description>
